---
import { resume } from '../data/resume';
import { withBase } from '../lib/urls';
---
<section class="hero container"><div class="hero-copy">
<p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> LLM AGENT / ALGORITHMS & ENGINEERING</p>
<h1>你好，我是<span class="name">周骏炜<span class="accent">。</span></span></h1>
<p class="hero-lead">构建 Agent 执行框架，<br/>连接上下文、策略与反馈。</p><p class="hero-description">{resume.tagline}</p>
<div class="actions"><a class="button primary" href={withBase('projects/')}>探索我的项目 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href={withBase('about/')}>关于我的经历 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
<div class="hero-meta"><span>香港中文大学 · AI 硕士在读</span><span>{resume.location}</span></div></div>
<figure class="system-figure" aria-label="LLM Agent 工程与后训练：上下文组织、Harness 执行以及轨迹反馈"><div class="figure-top"><span class="mono">AGENT ENGINEERING / 01</span><span class="figure-label">从上下文，到策略</span></div>
<div class="system-board"><div class="board-axis" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="system-node node-input"><span class="node-step">01 / CONTEXT</span><strong>Context Engineering</strong><small>Evidence · Memory · Budget</small></div><div class="flow-line" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
<div class="system-node node-tools"><span class="node-step">02 / HARNESS</span><strong>Agent Harness / Runtime</strong><small>Loop · Tools · Checkpoint</small><div class="node-tags"><span>route</span><span>resume</span><span>trace</span></div></div><div class="flow-line" aria-hidden="true">↓</div>
<div class="system-node node-verify"><span class="node-step">03 / POST-TRAINING</span><strong>Agentic RL / Evaluation</strong><small>Rollout · Reward · SFT / GRPO</small></div><span class="board-note mono">CONTEXT → HARNESS → FEEDBACK</span></div>
<figcaption><span class="tiny-dot"></span> 上下文如何影响执行，执行轨迹如何形成学习信号。</figcaption></figure></section>
